cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the accompanying paper below."
title: "DRL Robot Navigation in ROS 2 (TD3)"
abstract: >-
  Deep reinforcement learning (TD3) for goal-driven autonomous exploration and
  collision avoidance of a mobile robot in ROS 2 and Gazebo, with live SLAM
  mapping. A ROS 2 Foxy port of reiniscimurs/DRL-robot-navigation with added
  map generation during exploration.
